WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.855
If you’re an entrepreneur

00:00:02.545 --> 00:00:03.981
you can’t quit.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:06.062
You can’t throw in the towel

00:00:06.936 --> 00:00:07.561
It’s going to be tough.

00:00:08.321 --> 00:00:09.255
It’s going to be one of the hardest things

00:00:09.255 --> 00:00:10.062
you’ve ever done in your life

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:11.470
you’re going to doubt yourself

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:13.685
you’re going to wonder why you don’t go back and get a job

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:15.710
but you can’t quit

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:17.261
because starting a business

00:00:17.781 --> 00:00:18.832
takes time.

00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:20.653
Even if you model success

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.599
even if you’re the smartest person in the world

00:00:23.096 --> 00:00:24.222
it still takes time.

00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:26.214
I need you to make sure that you’re around

00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:27.744
when that success comes.

00:00:29.007 --> 00:00:31.592
Something you do right now may take a year before it comes back

00:00:31.592 --> 00:00:32.724
and that momentum grows.

00:00:32.915 --> 00:00:34.124
I need you to make sure you’re still here.

00:00:34.994 --> 00:00:35.623
You can’t quit.

00:00:37.088 --> 00:00:37.902
Milton Hershey

00:00:37.902 --> 00:00:40.061
who started the Hershey Chocolate Company

00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:42.681
he started his business when he was 18 years old

00:00:43.131 --> 00:00:44.985
Philadelphia, he borrowed a $100 from his aunt

00:00:44.985 --> 00:00:46.566
because he had no money to start up

00:00:46.782 --> 00:00:48.210
and he started in caramels

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:50.900
and he worked 15, 16 hours a day.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.019
He’d make the caramels at night

00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:55.243
and then he’d sell them on the streets during the day.

00:00:56.406 --> 00:00:57.583
The business in Philly failed.

00:00:58.905 --> 00:00:59.938
So he moved to Chicago

00:00:59.938 --> 00:01:00.899
and did the same thing

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:02.120
and that failed.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.622
He moved to New Orleans and did the same thing

00:01:05.219 --> 00:01:05.815
and that failed.

00:01:06.655 --> 00:01:08.141
And he moved to New York, tried it up again

00:01:09.364 --> 00:01:11.697
and one day he got robbed on the streets of New York.

00:01:12.063 --> 00:01:13.195
He lost all his inventory.

00:01:14.146 --> 00:01:15.017
He had to close down the business

00:01:15.017 --> 00:01:15.984
and return home to Philadelphia.

00:01:17.182 --> 00:01:19.508
He had spent 6 years building these businesses

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.597
in different states

00:01:22.527 --> 00:01:23.684
and they all failed.

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:26.243
He came back home to his family

00:01:27.081 --> 00:01:27.840
and they disowned him.

00:01:28.548 --> 00:01:29.372
They said, “You’re a failure.

00:01:30.003 --> 00:01:31.372
You’re not part of our family anymore.

00:01:32.104 --> 00:01:33.453
You’re not meant to be an entrepreneur."

00:01:35.283 --> 00:01:36.847
And so the only place he could stay

00:01:37.108 --> 00:01:39.431
was at the house of one of his former employees, Henry.

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:42.822
And Henry gave him a place to stay

00:01:42.822 --> 00:01:43.920
and a little bit of money to keep going

00:01:45.358 --> 00:01:47.536
because Milton Hershey had a new idea for a business.

00:01:48.827 --> 00:01:49.762
He wanted to get into chocolates.

00:01:51.136 --> 00:01:52.556
People said he was crazy

00:01:52.642 --> 00:01:54.792
like, “Hershey, this isn’t for you.

00:01:55.127 --> 00:01:56.305
You’re not meant to be an entrepreneur.

00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:59.248
You’ve worked 15, 16 hours a day for 6 years

00:01:59.248 --> 00:02:00.470
and you just had 4 failures.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.327
Go do something else.

00:02:02.702 --> 00:02:03.139
Go get a job.”

00:02:04.493 --> 00:02:05.027
But he couldn’t do it.

00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:07.254
He couldn’t quit. He knew it was in his blood.

00:02:07.254 --> 00:02:08.093
He had to go after it.

00:02:09.483 --> 00:02:11.436
Chocolate at the time was only for the rich people

00:02:12.294 --> 00:02:14.519
and he had discovered a machine that could make it affordable

00:02:14.605 --> 00:02:16.302
for everybody to do and to consume.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.978
So he started chocolate

00:02:20.688 --> 00:02:22.146
and the rest is history.

00:02:23.236 --> 00:02:24.651
He stuck around

00:02:24.651 --> 00:02:26.266
so he could achieve his success

00:02:26.466 --> 00:02:28.082
even when people didn’t believe in him

00:02:28.341 --> 00:02:30.773
even when he had failure after failure after failure.

00:02:30.773 --> 00:02:31.666
He lost everything

00:02:31.938 --> 00:02:32.871
he lost his family

00:02:33.911 --> 00:02:34.964
but he kept going.

00:02:35.574 --> 00:02:36.359
He didn’t quit.

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:39.760
I know it’s tough

00:02:40.663 --> 00:02:41.728
I know it’s hard as an entrepreneur.

00:02:42.988 --> 00:02:44.311
You may doubt yourself every day

00:02:45.343 --> 00:02:46.199
wonder if you should stop

00:02:47.789 --> 00:02:49.315
but just when the times are toughest

00:02:49.865 --> 00:02:51.301
when it’s darkest around you

00:02:52.287 --> 00:02:53.351
you have to go one more day.

00:02:54.079 --> 00:02:54.806
You can’t quit.

00:02:55.839 --> 00:02:56.808
If you’re following your passion

00:02:57.432 --> 00:02:58.832
and you’re helping people

00:02:58.972 --> 00:03:00.092
you can’t quit.

00:03:01.902 --> 00:03:03.192
The light is around the tunnel.

00:03:03.856 --> 00:03:04.293
It’s there.

00:03:04.521 --> 00:03:05.115
I promise you.

00:03:05.293 --> 00:03:07.376
Even if you can’t see it now it’s there.

00:03:07.781 --> 00:03:09.381
And you have to take that one more step

00:03:09.576 --> 00:03:10.486
go one more day

00:03:11.446 --> 00:03:12.686
so you can achieve it.

00:03:14.296 --> 00:03:15.188
Good luck.

